        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>MNG 849, Riverstone 8 Inch Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 8 Inch Riverstone Cabinet Pull is a rustic looking cabinet knob perfect for historic homes or farmhouses. The Riverstone 8 Inch Pull is available in a few beautiful finish colors. It is easy to install and comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet pull is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=MNG+Riverstone\">MNG Riverstone Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the MNG 849 Riverstone 8 Inch Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Material: Zinc </li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> \r\n</p>",
